PROJECT={project}
LANGUAGE={lang}
LANGUAGE_QWEN_PROMPT={_oc_prog_language_prompt(project)}
PRIMARY_TARGET={_oc_prog_primary_target(project)}
Compare the previous candidate with the live project files. Apply the developer's rewrite instructions while preserving the project's language, architecture/toolchain, folder conventions, and intended behavior.
Return ONLY the complete revised candidate source text for the primary editable artifact. Do not use markdown fences or <progfile> tags.
<PreviousCandidate>
{previous}
