            "An equal black-white mixture gives middle gray in the simplified scalar model. Different proportions produce darker or lighter gray."
        ),
        _qa(
            "How does gray provide a basis for secondary colors?",
            "It demonstrates that combining reference deviations can create an intermediate or secondary state. AItech can generalize a mixing function M(A,B,r) to other deviation pairs while keeping the resulting interpretations theoretical until defined."
        ),
        _qa(
