 *
 * KEY INPUT:
 *   Keyboard.installHardwareBridge passes WASD/SPACE/ESC/E through to the
 *   embedded IceSandbox panel when state.isGameModeActive is true.
 *   All other Matrix keys (FN, modifiers, session switching) still work.
 *
