/*
 * PlayerPhysics.java
 *
 * Merged spherical movement and Geordi-glasses camera physics.
 *
 * Contributors:
 *   Gemini (Google)        — original physics concept
 *   Derek Jason Gilhousen — per-planet gravity, spherical walking design,
